            "notes": "## Items\n\n### Required\n\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n\n### Optional\n\n- [Thermal Traps](item_eadfe43a-fe6d-438c-b4d7-0f78e6d7705e)\n\n  - Not necessary as of yet since we don't get [Double Trouble](item_850f4701-cb41-4083-ba0e-7f96b6757025) until next round.\n\n- [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36)\n\n  - This may seem like an odd choice, but the bonus attack speed lets us refresh abilities faster, and the 5% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) is more important than the 5% movement speed of [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).\n\n#### Extra cash\n\n- [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34)\n\n  - Further increasing uptime and your pressure output.",
